<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Project>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Version>0.2.0</Version>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>`FerretOptions.Offline` and `FerretOptions.IgnorePatterns`, library equivalents of `FERRET_OFFLINE` and the ignore rules, so a host process need not set environment variables or write ignore files.
GitHub release assets are now archives (`ferret-&lt;rid&gt;.tar.gz`, `.zip` on Windows) holding the exe and the ONNX Runtime library it loads. A `ferret-bundled-&lt;rid&gt;` archive per platform embeds the semantic model and works offline.
`--sem` and `--hybrid` crashed with `DllNotFoundException: onnxruntime` on the release binaries, because the library was left out of the upload.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <!-- Flexi.Yaml needs at least this FSharp.Core; the SDK's implicit version is older. -->
    <FSharpCoreImplicitPackageVersion>10.1.403</FSharpCoreImplicitPackageVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Authors>Devon Burriss</Authors>
    <Copyright>Copyright © 2026 Devon Burriss</Copyright>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageTags>search;bm25;semantic-search;hybrid-search;ripgrep;fsharp</PackageTags>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/dburriss/ferret</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/dburriss/ferret</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>